---

<section id="mission" class="mission container" data-reveal-group="140">
  <div class="mission__intro">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="up">Our Mission</p>
    <p class="mission__headline" data-split="words" data-split-step="55">
        It takes a village — we're building ours.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="mission__body lead" data-reveal="up">
    We envision communities that own their needs, answer them together, and believe in one another. That's the culture we're building and looking to inspire!
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .mission {
    padding-block: 130px 110px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .mission .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .mission__headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 960px;
  }
  .mission__body {
    width: 100%;
    max-width:441px;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 26px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .mission {
      padding-block: 72px 64px;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
